	-20 -6 RM 0 12 RL 40 0 RM 0 -12 RL stroke
	M 5 SLW -20 0 RM 40 0 RL stroke}!
/mrep{	2 copy 2 copy
	M -5 3 RM currentpoint 1.4 0 360 arc
	M 5 -3 RM currentpoint 1.4 0 360 arc
	M -7 -6 RM 11 12 RL 3 0 RL -11 -12 RL -3 0 RL fill}!
