	2.3 0 RM 0 exch RL stroke}!
/gd{	.6 SLW x y M
	-2.3 0 RM 0 exch RL stroke}!
/sgu{	.6 SLW x y M 2.3 0 RM
	0 exch RL currentpoint stroke
	M dup 1 eq{
